1. OPENCLAW (MIT)
================================================================================

Rem is built on OpenClaw, via our fork at https://github.com/Rem-Assistant/openclaw
(vendored as the `openclaw/` git submodule).

  Upstream project: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw
  License:          MIT
  Pinned commit:    fb3a259572ff5d29750576d9528e7443df65ad99

